    "agent-optimize": {
      "component": "algorithm",
      "path": "algorithms/agent-optimize",
      "summary": "Fully-agentic, free-form optimization loop the conversational agent owns end to end \u2014 it understands the benchmark/inputs first, proposes capability edits itself (serially, or several siblings in parallel working copies with unique rollout tags), kills bad candidates cheaply on a deterministic, seeded, informative SUBSET of val (a promotion ladder that can only kill, never accept), and accepts only on a full-val PAIRED significance gate plus a no-regression veto \u2014 all bounded by a free-text stop_condition parsed into re-checkable predicates and re-read from the run dir every round, and finished with one honest train/val/sealed-test measurement. Agent-mode only (orchestration_mode agent).",
